  "details": "In some avatar-search worlds, like Prismic’s for example, I’ve noticed that certain AVM avatars are listed there automatically. When you click on them, nothing happens. It would be great if, instead of doing nothing, clicking brought up the AVM listing for that avatar. I know there are Udon integrations available to do this, but having the functionality built in natively—without any input needed from the world author—would be a huge improvement.",
